      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.59,
      "end_seconds": 4.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Doctor, we're ready in room two, I've already taken the observations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.83,
      "end_seconds": 10.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Okay, thanks. Hi, how can I help today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.29,
      "end_seconds": 19.17,
      "duration_seconds": 7.88,
      "text": "Mainly pain in my lower back. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.96,
      "end_seconds": 22.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.15,
      "end_seconds": 27.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "I take Volini gel, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.07,
      "end_seconds": 34.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.43,
      "end_seconds": 43.0,
      "duration_seconds": 7.57,
      "text": "About... well, about two weeks. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.03,
      "end_seconds": 54.34,
      "duration_seconds": 9.31,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.22,
      "end_seconds": 67.61,
      "duration_seconds": 12.39,
      "text": "oh, only lying flat, and it's not much. Yes, sitting for long. That makes it worse. It happens a few times a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.21,
      "end_seconds": 75.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Any difficulty bending forward as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.25,
      "end_seconds": 78.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Yes, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.61,
      "end_seconds": 82.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Any weight loss or numbness in the legs at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.73,
      "end_seconds": 89.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "I haven't had weight loss or numbness in the legs, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.89,
      "end_seconds": 94.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "and what about weakness in the legs or bladder problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.14,
      "end_seconds": 99.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "no, not a a single one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.76,
      "end_seconds": 102.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "How's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.87,
      "end_seconds": 105.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.67,
      "end_seconds": 108.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.82,
      "end_seconds": 111.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.97,
      "end_seconds": 125.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.74,
      "end_seconds": 129.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "no, uh, nothing at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.31,
      "end_seconds": 147.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.75,
      "end_seconds": 150.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "no, um, never"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.86,
      "end_seconds": 156.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.53,
      "end_seconds": 161.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.82,
      "end_seconds": 164.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "okay, and your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.14,
      "end_seconds": 168.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 172.28,
      "end_seconds": 189.83,
      "duration_seconds": 17.55,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Temperature 36.9, oxygen saturation is 99 percent. Blood pressure 111 over 79, pulse is 67 beats a minute, BMI works out to 28.4, height 177 centimetres, weight 89 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.03,
      "end_seconds": 192.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.08,
      "end_seconds": 198.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "let me look at the area, I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.32,
      "end_seconds": 214.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.52,
      "end_seconds": 217.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "breathe out slowly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.78,
      "end_seconds": 241.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "there's tenderness over the muscles on the right of the lower back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.6,
      "end_seconds": 244.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.17,
      "end_seconds": 250.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.13,
      "end_seconds": 278.48,
      "duration_seconds": 13.35,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, the most likely explanation is mechanical low back pain. The The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.46,
      "end_seconds": 282.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.57,
      "end_seconds": 299.76,
      "duration_seconds": 15.19,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's mechanical low back pain, and we'll watch how it goes. Right, today I'm not changing anything. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.29,
      "end_seconds": 304.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "great, thank you for your help"
    }
  ]
